OL,3,CWest Indies Cricketer sets new record
OL,4,Cwith incredible bowling performance
OL,6,FBarbadian all-rounder Justin Greaves
OL,7,Fclaimed a five wicket haul without
OL,8,Fconceding a single run in a spell that
OL,9,Fleft Pakistan reeling in their first
OL,10,Ftest in the series against the West
OL,11,FIndies.
OL,13,FGreaves went on to record career best
OL,14,Ffigures of 5-27 as the visitors were
OL,15,Fdismissed for 282 in their first
OL,16,Finnings.
