OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F328A1785669497
OL,3,CWest Indies Cricketer sets new record
OL,4,Cwith incredible bowling performance
OL,6,FAfter he conceded 27 runs in his first
OL,7,Fspell, he returned to bowl five
OL,8,Fconsecutive wicket maidens in a Test
OL,9,Fmatch, something never before recorded
OL,10,Fat the game's elite level.
OL,12,FThe previous record was held by former
OL,13,FEngland seamer Stuart Broad who
OL,14,Fclaimed four wickets without conceding
OL,15,Fa run against South Africa in 2016.
OL,17,F32-year-old Greaves made his debut for
OL,18,Fthe West Indies in 2022 having
OL,19,Fpreviously had spells for a number of
OL,20,FEnglish club sides earlier in his
OL,21,Fcareer.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G2/3
